\textbf{Scoring} & \textbf{Seed} & \textbf{Ign-F1} & \textbf{rel\_F1} & \textbf{evi\_F1} & \textbf{EDCR} \\
\midrule
CED & s42 & 44.23 & .4517 & .8175 & .6569 \\
CED & s43 & 45.12 & .4601 & .8063 & .6542 \\
CED & s44 & 45.11 & .4621 & .8050 & .6350 \\
CED & s45 & 44.16 & .4514 & .8174 & .6550 \\
